//! The `stroke-width` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property defines the
//! width of a stroke applied to the [SVG](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG) shape.
//! If present, it overrides the element's `stroke-width` attribute.
//!
//! Initial: 1px. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: refer to the normalized diagonal measure of the current SVG viewport's applied
//! `viewBox`, or of the viewport itself if no viewBox is specified.
//!
//! Grammar: [ <length-percentage> | <line-width> | <number> ]#
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/fill-stroke-3/#propdef-stroke-width
//!
//! Author guide: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/stroke-width
